   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the project is to support the strengthening of human rights and reducing the problems of overcrowded prisons. The project supports the Ministry of Justice of Georgia in establishing the Training Centre for the prison and probation system. Activities include curricula development and training of trainers in line with Council of Europe recommendations.</narrative>
